                        "text": "var b=Math.floor(time/0.45454545454545453),f=(time%0.45454545454545453)/0.45454545454545453;var a=Math.abs(Math.sin(b*1.7+0)),z=Math.abs(Math.sin((b-1)*1.7+0));var e=1-Math.pow(1-Math.min(f*3,1),3);[100,(0.15+0.85*(z+(a-z)*e))*100,100]",
